<h2 id="create-an-admin-interface" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create an admin interface</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-an-admin-interface" aria-label="Link to Create an admin interface"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>The admin interface we&#x27;ve built allows administrators to toggle feature flags on and off through the UI. It includes:</p>
<ol>
<li>A list of all feature flags in the system</li>
<li>Toggle switches for enabling/disabling flags</li>
<li>JavaScript to update flags via API calls</li>
</ol>
<p>The admin interface is already integrated into our application with the <code>AdminPage</code> handler and <code>admin.html</code> template.</p>
